# Ironreef Caverns' fallen drift (CIPlay ironreef_caverns_spikes, 11-04): the floor there and the player stood in the
# spikes' rubble for a few seconds. Run under CIGapsWatchHealth: the spikes must cost health (zone.damage 4).
island Ironreef Caverns keep
offset 1.3339 0.1645
hour 11
weather Calm
expect stand -25.25 -24.92 h=19.2 below=22
expect stand -25.53 -22.33 h=19.2 below=22
expect stand -23.12 -24.58 h=19.3 below=22
at -25.25 -24.92 h=20.4
wait 3
picture ir_spikes -22.6 20.8 -26.5 -25.4 19.2 -23.5
wait 3
# off the spikes again when done (left standing on them, the player died over and over after the play - 11-05)
at -23.12 -24.58 h=20.4
wait 2
